  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Direction vector of normal to the plane <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Hence, direction ratio of normal to the plane <math><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p>Thus, equation of plane is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, perpendicular distance from origin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
